  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Africa Groups of Sweden Information contribution for the period        2013-2015. AGS is a solidarity organisation active since three       decades. Apart from its development support to actors in Southern     Africa, the organisation is informing its members and the Swedish     public on issues related to the Southern African context.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Afrikagruppernas Informationsanslag f&#xf6;r 2013-2015. Ramorganisationen  Afrikagrupperna &#xe4;r en solidaritetsr&#xf6;relse som bedrivit                bist&#xe5;ndsverksamhet i tre decennier. Organisationen arbetar ocks&#xe5; med  informations- och kommunikationsfr&#xe5;gor i Sverige. Bland annat driver  man kampanjer kopplade till r&#xe4;ttighetsarbete i S&#xf6;dra Afrika</narrative>
  </description>
